    "sections": {
        "description": "Rinico is a modern business and agency block theme built for Full Site Editing. It comes with ready-made patterns for hero sections, services, pricing tables, FAQ, team, testimonials, stats, contact details and calls to action, plus complete About, Services, Pricing and Contact page layouts you can add in one click. A full blog is included too, with archive, search, sidebar and single post templates. Color palettes, typography variations and section styles let you match your brand without writing code."
